1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,614
There are two classes.

2
00:00:01,614 --> 00:00:10,312
In Fresnel diffraction, the source and screen are at finite distances, the wavefronts are curved, and the mathematics is hard.

3
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:18,098
In Fraunhofer diffraction, source and screen are effectively at infinity, the wavefronts are plane, and lenses are used.

4
00:00:18,098 --> 00:00:25,872
Everything in this unit is Fraunhofer: parallel light in, parallel light out, brought to a focus by a lens.

